Z||000008||Rodney||03-28-2000||06:24 PM||||I get mine from the same source. Quality is very good. Some pages with a gray background are blochy. That is only a few pages though. But overall very nice. I doubt anyone else will ever do this in a reprint style. At least these copy style ones are available or the ones on ebay would go sky high in the years to come!!!<P>Rodney Dickman||||reg||1
